1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:13,700
Did the boy go where he wanted to?
男孩到了他想去的地方吗？

2
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:16,890
Did the boy go where he wanted to?
男孩到了他想去的地方吗？

3
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:24,630
Children who play truant from school are unimaginative.
逃学的孩子们都缺乏想像力。

4
00:00:26,140 --> 00:00:27,770
A quiet days' fishing,
安静地钓上一天鱼，

5
00:00:27,790 --> 00:00:34,550
or eight hours in a cinema seeing the same film over and over again, is usually as far as they get.
或在电影院里坐上八个小时，一遍遍地看同一部电影，他们通常也就做到这种程度。

6
00:00:34,570 --> 00:00:44,680
They have all been put to shame by a boy who, while playing truant travelled 1, 600 miles.
有一个逃学的男孩却使所有这些人相形见绌，他旅行了1,600英里。

7
00:00:45,930 --> 00:00:49,590
He hitchhiked to Dover and towards evening
他搭便车到了多佛，天快黑时

8
00:00:49,610 --> 00:00:52,890
went into a boat to find somewhere to sleep.
钻进一条船里找个地方睡觉。

9
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,250
When he woke up next morning,
第二天早上他醒来时，

10
00:00:56,270 --> 00:01:02,570
he discovered that the boat had, in the meantime, travelled to Calais.
发现船在这段时间里已经开到了加来。

11
00:01:02,810 --> 00:01:06,800
No one noticed the boy as he crept off.
他偷偷下船时没人注意到他。

12
00:01:07,390 --> 00:01:11,850
From there, he hitchhiked to Paris in a lorry.
从那里他又搭上一辆卡车到了巴黎。

13
00:01:12,880 --> 00:01:19,270
The driver gave him a few biscuits and a cup of coffee and left him just outside the city.
司机给了他几块饼干和一杯咖啡，把他在城外丢下。

14
00:01:20,260 --> 00:01:26,950
The next car the boy stopped did not take him into the centre of Paris as he hoped it would,
男孩拦住的下一辆车没有像他希望的那样把他带到巴黎市中心，

15
00:01:26,970 --> 00:01:31,090
but to Perpignan on the French-Spanish border.
而是把他带到了法西边境的佩皮尼昂。

16
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:38,610
There he was picked up by a policeman and sent back to England by the local authorities.
在那里他被一名警察发现，由当地当局送回了英国。

17
00:01:39,630 --> 00:01:45,780
He has surely set up a record for the thousands of children who dream of evading school.
他无疑为成千上万梦想逃学的孩子们创下了一项纪录。
